    "text": "You break ground behind the hall — bed 2 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 20s telling A woman, maybe 40s, with freckles about A person, maybe 50s. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."
   },
