    "day": 2,
    "text": "— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "🔥 “I don’t say this lightly.” Maya sets their bowl down. “Elena, your trade story isn’t true, is it? I’ve heard enough versions now.” Nobody looks at Elena. Everybody does."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A woman, maybe 40s, with freckles will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "You step into the Haven hall."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📋 A person, maybe 50s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A woman, maybe 30s, with grey-streaked hair watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📋 A woman, maybe 40s, with freckles — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "(Talking costs a little energy — 10 kcal a conversation. Small talk is cheap; going deep costs time, not more food.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "...and then it lands: A man, maybe 60s speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"Gonzalo,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Gonzalo.\" You'll remember that."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: learned their name (Gonzalo)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"Willow,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Willow.\" You'll remember that."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: learned their name (Willow)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"Maya,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Maya.\" You'll remember that."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: learned their name (Maya)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "You eat Dried meat and Trail mix (1400 kcal)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "It's barely dawn. The day is yours — sleep is for later."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "No risky water to boil."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Drank clean water."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A woman, maybe 60s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "🌿 Willow checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~5 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "🪵 Willow hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (14 logs now.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "💧 A woman, maybe 40s, with freckles returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 40s, with a slouched posture telling A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands about Willow. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A woman, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Gonzalo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "🚶 Maya is back — found A woman, maybe 40s, with freckles."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."
